{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"Git.MinGit","latestVersion":"2.56.0.4","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"MinGit is an intentionally minimal, non-interactive distribution of Git for Windows, with third-party applications as its intended audience.","license":"GPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/git-for-windows/git/blob/HEAD/COPYING","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"MinGit is an intentionally minimal, non-interactive distribution of Git for Windows, with third-party applications as its intended audience.","license":"GPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/git-for-windows/git/blob/HEAD/COPYING","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"MinGit is a minimal, lightweight version of Git for Windows that includes only the core Git command-line tools.\nIt's designed for automated environments, CI/CD pipelines, and users who need basic Git functionality without the full Git for Windows package, which includes Git Bash, GUI tools, and other utilities.\nMinGit offers a smaller footprint and can be used portably without installation.","moniker":"mingit","name":"MinGit","packageUrl":"https://gitforwindows.org/","publisher":"The Git Development Community","publisherUrl":"https://gitforwindows.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/git-for-windows/git/releases/tag/v2.56.0.windows.4","tags":["cli","command-line","commandline","cross-platform","dvcs","foss","git","open-source","tool","utility","vcs"]}},"longDescription":"MinGit is a minimal, lightweight version of Git for Windows that includes only the core Git command-line tools.\nIt's designed for automated environments, CI/CD pipelines, and users who need basic Git functionality without the full Git for Windows package, which includes Git Bash, GUI tools, and other utilities.\nMinGit offers a smaller footprint and can be used portably without installation.","moniker":"mingit","name":"MinGit","packageUrl":"https://gitforwindows.org/","publisher":"The Git Deve